Public evaluation-source datasets (C.Walts v0.4 Gate 0)

Three public datasets were acquired as EVALUATION-QUERY CANDIDATES. They are
test inputs, not knowledge. None is ingested into badgr_natural_flow_v1, chunked,
embedded, or indexed, and none is redistributed: the archives and their extracted
files stay under the Git-ignored var/eval_sources/ and are never committed. This
preserves the A7 distinction the project has kept throughout — CMUdict remains
the only third-party text that would be INGESTED, and its path is still empty.

Acquired and license-verified 2026-08-01 by reading the LICENSE file inside each
downloaded archive, not from a publisher page. Per-file SHA-256 values are in
docs/dataset-acquisition-report-gate0.md; the machine-readable record is
config/approved_eval_datasets.json.

